🎓 QUICK REFERENCE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Pattern                                  │ Meaning
──────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────
column BETWEEN x AND y                  │ value is between x and y, inclusive
column NOT BETWEEN x AND y              │ value is outside the range x..y
text_column BETWEEN 'A' AND 'M'         │ text falls alphabetically between A and M
date_column BETWEEN '2024-01-01' AND '2024-12-31' │ dates in year 2024


