SUMMARY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

• BETWEEN selects values inside an inclusive range.
• Helpful for numeric, text, and date filtering.
• NOT BETWEEN selects values outside that range.
• Use correct data types and formats.
• Combine with IN and other conditions for stronger filtering.
• Handle NULL values explicitly.
• Good for readable, maintainable range queries.

